2. Arithmetic Expressions
+ - * / % (modulo = remainder after division)

-- Combined sales in millions (from your query #1)
SELECT title,
       (domestic_sales + international_sales) / 1000000 AS gross_sales_millions
FROM movies
JOIN boxoffice ON movies.id = boxoffice.movie_id;
-- Even-year releases (modulo — from your query #3)
SELECT title, year
FROM movies
WHERE year % 2 = 0;      -- 1998, 2004, 2006, 2008, 2010, 2012 ...
-- Movie length in hours (division)
SELECT title, length_minutes / 60.0 AS length_hours
FROM movies;
Tip: Integer division drops decimals — 5 / 2 = 2, but 5 / 2.0 = 2.5.

